  "description": "Sailfish is a simple in-process performance test framework for writing clean, manageable performance tests\n            against your component or API. The general intention is to provide a simple tool that teams can use to write straight forward\n            tests that assess the speed of your code, without weighing you down with all the extra ceremony.",
